 "observations": [
  "body L3, L6-L9, L13, L20, L22, L25-L27, L33: the dashes of the transliterated names and of «156–158» are long dashes (5.0 to 5.5 pt); in L22 «al-Battānī» has a hyphen (3.2 pt).",
  "body L10, L14: the dashes between the dates measure 9.5 pt and are transcribed as dashes. Counted from 15 July 622, the year 214 of the hegira runs from 10 March 829 to 26 February 830 and the year 217 from 6 February 832 to 25 January 833; the years 198, 201, 220 and 234 of Yazdegerd begin on 28 April 829, 27 April 832, 23 April 851 and 19 April 865.",
  "body L15, L28-L29: the motion 359° 45′ 46″ 33‴ 50ⁱᵛ 43ᵛ belongs to a year of 365d 5h 46m 20s,6, close to the year of Yaḥyà (L35); the excess of the observation of Damascus in Ḥabash (L28) gives 359° 45′ 45″ 32‴ in 365 days.",
  "body L27-L35: at 4 minutes of time to the degree, 86° 43′ 39″ 36‴ 47ⁱᵛ is 5h 46m 54s,640870, 86° 41′ 25″ 14‴ 9ⁱᵛ is 5h 46m 45s,682389 (printed 45.682388) and 86° 35′ 13″ 46‴ is 5h 46m 20s,917778 (printed 20.917777).",
  "body L30-L31: 86° 43′ 39″ 37‴ is 5h 46m 54s 38ᵗ 28 in time; the printed 36ᵗ is the value of 86° 43′ 39″ alone.",
  "body L34, L36: a space follows the decimal point of «45.682388» and «54.6» in the print.",
  "body L37-L38: 365 times the daily motion 0° 59′ 8″ 20‴ 35ⁱᵛ 25ᵛ gives the printed motion in 365 days exactly; both belong to a year of 365d 5h 46m 52s,5, while the year of 365d 5h 46m 54s,6 of L36 gives 0° 59′ 8″ 20‴ 34ⁱᵛ 32ᵛ a day.",
  "body L39-L40: 5h 48m 47s,5 is 0d,2422164 (printed 0,2422166); 360° in 365,2422166 days give 0° 59′ 8″,3302 a day, as printed, and 359° 45′ 40″,535 in 365 days (printed 40″,523).",
  "notes_right L1-L2: the dashes of «133-35» and «169-176» measure 2.9 to 3.0 pt, hyphens; «Caliphat» is printed for Caliphate.",
  "notes_right L4: the Arabic letters after 44″ and 45″ write these numbers in the abjad notation (مد = 44, مه = 45)."
 ],
